## Check the implementation

Test keyboard opening, focus retention while data changes, long summaries and printing. Make the information readable without a custom JavaScript controller.

Use the [civica.uk accessibility checks](../accessibility/testing.html) and compare the rendered result in light and dark modes, Vivid and Muted tones, and at 320 CSS pixels. The example markup is a starting point; a theme alone does not add its application logic.

## Source and related guidance

[NHS details](https://service-manual.nhs.uk/design-system/components/details) informs the component choice and interaction guidance. The examples use shared GOV.UK primitives or original civica.uk markup, Arial typography and civica.uk assets. NHS logos and service identity are not used.

See also [device controls](devices.html).
